referable to avoid entirely, over just using it carefully.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191341940/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191513043","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109612#issuecomment-3191513043","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109612","id":3191513043,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-Op_T","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T13:33:17Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T13:33:17Z","body":"> In the case of the bug that brought this to the forefront, I believe it's the number of elements, not the number of calls.\r\n\r\nIn this particular case then it's probably largely academic, and not a hill to die on either way. :+1: \r\n\r\nBTW I did have a little look at the relative costs.\r\n\r\nCosts processing wise are pretty similar between `alloca` and a fixed array afaik .. `alloca` can do a small calculation for how much to increment the stack, but nothing worth worrying about in the context of such a function, and will use the precise memory needed on the stack rather than wasting space (more chance of overflows, possibility of being less cache friendly).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191513043/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3192330324","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109612#issuecomment-3192330324","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109612","id":3192330324,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-RxhU","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T18:04:49Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T18:04:49Z","body":"Thanks! ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https:/